WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.247 --> 00:00:13.630
- [Narrator] One of the distinct features

00:00:13.630 --> 00:00:16.530
of this operation has been that

00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:20.550
Israel has targeted a number
of high-rise buildings in Gaza.

00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:25.550
The Israeli military is using
tanks and artillery fire,

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:29.013
unmanned drones, and other
sophisticated weapons.

00:00:30.190 --> 00:00:32.930
The Palestinian militants
are firing mainly

00:00:32.930 --> 00:00:35.356
unguided rockets into Israel.

00:00:35.356 --> 00:00:37.939
(upbeat music)

00:00:50.604 --> 00:00:53.354
(bomb exploding)

00:00:55.420 --> 00:00:58.820
So there's been a quite of
wide path of destruction

00:00:58.820 --> 00:01:03.110
on the civilian infrastructure
and civilian homes in Gaza.

00:01:04.263 --> 00:01:06.846
(upbeat music)

00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:25.250
Two specific towers that housed a number

00:01:25.250 --> 00:01:28.530
of media organizations,
including one that housed both

00:01:28.530 --> 00:01:30.940
the Associated Press and Al Jazeera,

00:01:30.940 --> 00:01:34.720
the Israelis gave warning
to the owner of the building

00:01:34.720 --> 00:01:38.490
to evacuate the building
and journalists from the AP,

00:01:38.490 --> 00:01:41.570
and these other organizations
had to flee for their lives

00:01:41.570 --> 00:01:43.010
before it was demolished.

00:01:43.010 --> 00:01:44.630
The Israelis have said that there were

00:01:44.630 --> 00:01:46.540
Hamas military intelligence,

00:01:46.540 --> 00:01:49.110
using some offices in this building.

00:01:49.110 --> 00:01:51.660
Both the AP and other
organizations have said

00:01:51.660 --> 00:01:54.643
that they had no evidence
that that was the case.

00:01:57.010 --> 00:01:59.494
(bomb exploding)

00:01:59.494 --> 00:02:02.077
(upbeat music)

00:02:18.170 --> 00:02:21.740
Gaza is territorially the
size of Washington DC,

00:02:21.740 --> 00:02:25.770
but with the population about
three times the size of DC.

00:02:25.770 --> 00:02:29.640
And so you can imagine the
difficulty of trying to

00:02:29.640 --> 00:02:32.690
separate civilians from
anything you might be

00:02:32.690 --> 00:02:34.627
trying to bomb in Gaza.

00:02:34.627 --> 00:02:37.210
(upbeat music)

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:45.820
The Israeli military says that

00:02:45.820 --> 00:02:48.940
what it's been targeting
is a system of tunnels

00:02:48.940 --> 00:02:52.410
used by Palestinian
militants that is underneath

00:02:52.410 --> 00:02:54.670
the neighborhoods of the Gaza strip,

00:02:54.670 --> 00:02:57.840
as well as rocket construction facilities,

00:02:57.840 --> 00:02:59.850
and militant leaders,

00:02:59.850 --> 00:03:03.090
that it says are responsible
for these rocket attacks

00:03:03.090 --> 00:03:04.980
from Gaza into Israel.

00:03:04.980 --> 00:03:07.920
What we've found in our reporting is that

00:03:07.920 --> 00:03:12.459
a lot of civilians have
died in these attacks.

00:03:12.459 --> 00:03:15.042
(upbeat music)

00:03:21.730 --> 00:03:24.530
Israel has said that they
were targeting a tunnel

00:03:24.530 --> 00:03:27.000
and that the collapse of the building

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:30.690
was in accidental result of that attack.

00:03:30.690 --> 00:03:34.070
It's a situation where
there are many people

00:03:34.070 --> 00:03:35.560
the vast majority of them civilians

00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:39.450
who are scared for their lives,
and they have nowhere to run

00:03:39.450 --> 00:03:40.820
because they live in a territory

00:03:40.820 --> 00:03:42.910
that's been cut off
from the outside world,

00:03:42.910 --> 00:03:47.223
and it's a very dense urban center.

00:03:47.223 --> 00:03:49.806
(upbeat music)

00:03:57.467 --> 00:04:00.250
They're reaching further
into Israeli territory

00:04:00.250 --> 00:04:02.410
attacking Tel Aviv and Jerusalem.

00:04:02.410 --> 00:04:03.500
Israelis will tell you that

00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:07.040
they are constantly hearing
sirens that force them to run

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:08.643
to their bomb shelters.

00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:13.050
Palestinian militants, they
are using deadly weapons,

00:04:13.050 --> 00:04:14.290
there's no doubt about that.

00:04:14.290 --> 00:04:16.290
But they are at a disadvantage

00:04:16.290 --> 00:04:18.330
when it comes to fighting Israel,

00:04:18.330 --> 00:04:20.743
which is simply a much
more powerful military.

00:04:21.800 --> 00:04:24.890
Israel has a missile defense
system called the Iron Dome,

00:04:24.890 --> 00:04:29.690
which has intercepted they
say about 90% of rockets

00:04:29.690 --> 00:04:31.474
that have reached Israeli territory.

00:04:31.474 --> 00:04:34.057
(upbeat music)

